{"path":"/docs","rootClass":"container mx-auto px-6 py-16 max-w-4xl","breadcrumb":null,"children":[{"t":"a","c":"text-sm text-primary hover:underline mb-6 inline-block","x":"← Back to Home"},{"t":"h1","c":"text-4xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3","x":"Documentation"},{"t":"p","c":"text-muted-foreground mb-12 text-lg","x":"Get started with Pixelco in under 5 minutes."},{"t":"div","c":"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mb-14","h":"<div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-6 bg-card shadow-card\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-settings w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.671 4.136a2.34 2.34 0 0 1 4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1 2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0 3.831 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.32-1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33-4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0-3.831A2.34 2.34 0 0 1 6.35 6.051a2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319-1.915\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2\">1. Create Your Account</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Sign up for a free Pixelco account and add your website domain in the dashboard.</p></div><div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-6 bg-card shadow-card\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 18 6-6-6-6\"></path><path d=\"m8 6-6 6 6 6\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2\">2. Install the Pixel</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Copy the pixel code snippet and paste it into the &lt;head&gt; section of your website, just before the closing &lt;/head&gt; tag.</p></div><div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-6 bg-card shadow-card\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2\">3. Verify Installation</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Visit your website and check the Pixelco dashboard — you should see a green 'Active' status within a few minutes.</p></div><div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-6 bg-card shadow-card\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-2\">4. Start Identifying</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">That's it! Pixelco will begin identifying anonymous visitors and populating your dashboard with contact data in real time.</p></div>"},{"t":"h2","c":"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4","x":"Example Pixel Code"},{"t":"div","c":"bg-yellow-500/10 border border-yellow-500/30 rounded-xl p-4 mb-4 flex items-start gap-3","h":"<span class=\"text-yellow-500 text-lg mt-0.5\">⚠️</span><p class=\"text-sm text-yellow-300 leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"text-yellow-400\">This is a sample snippet for illustration only.</strong> Your real, unique pixel code will be generated automatically when you complete onboarding in your <a href=\"https://app.pixelco.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-primary underline hover:no-underline\">Pixelco dashboard</a>.</p>"},{"t":"div","c":"relative mb-14","h":"<div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 bg-yellow-500/20 text-yellow-400 text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">SAMPLE</div><pre class=\"bg-card border border-yellow-500/20 rounded-xl p-5 pt-10 overflow-x-auto text-sm font-mono text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed opacity-80\">&lt;!-- Pixelco Tracking Pixel --&gt;\n&lt;script&gt;\n  (function(p,i,x,e,l){\n    p._pxid=p._pxid||[];\n    var s=i.createElement('script');\n    s.async=true;\n    s.src='https://cdn.pixelco.com/pixel.js';\n    s.setAttribute('data-site-id',e);\n    var f=i.getElementsByTagName('script')[0];\n    f.parentNode.insertBefore(s,f);\n  })(window,document,'pxid','YOUR_SITE_ID');\n&lt;/script&gt;</pre><button class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 p-2 rounded-md bg-secondary/80 hover:bg-secondary text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button>"},{"t":"h2","c":"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4","x":"Platform-Specific Instructions"},{"t":"div","c":"space-y-4 mb-14","h":"<div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-5 bg-card shadow-card\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">WordPress</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Go to Appearance → Theme Editor → header.php. Paste the pixel code before &lt;/head&gt;. Or use a plugin like 'Insert Headers &amp; Footers'.</p></div><div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-5 bg-card shadow-card\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">Shopify</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Go to Online Store → Themes → Edit Code → theme.liquid. Paste the pixel code before &lt;/head&gt;.</p></div><div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-5 bg-card shadow-card\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">Webflow</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Go to Project Settings → Custom Code → Head Code. Paste the pixel code and publish.</p></div><div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-5 bg-card shadow-card\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">Wix</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Go to Settings → Custom Code → Add Custom Code. Paste the pixel code, set it to load on all pages in the Head.</p></div><div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-5 bg-card shadow-card\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">Next.js / React</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Add the script tag to your _document.tsx (Next.js) or index.html (React/Vite) inside the &lt;head&gt; tag.</p></div><div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-5 bg-card shadow-card\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">Custom HTML</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Paste the pixel code directly into the &lt;head&gt; section of every page, or in your shared layout/template file.</p></div>"},{"t":"h2","c":"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4","x":"Common Questions"},{"t":"div","c":"space-y-4 mb-10","h":"<div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-5 bg-card\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">Does the pixel slow down my website?</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">No. The Pixelco script is loaded asynchronously and is under 5KB — it has zero impact on page load speed.</p></div><div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-5 bg-card\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">Is the pixel GDPR compliant?</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Pixelco is 100% cookieless and does not use cookies or local storage. However, you should consult your legal team about disclosure requirements in your jurisdiction.</p></div><div class=\"border border-border rounded-xl p-5 bg-card\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">How quickly will I see results?</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">You'll start seeing identified visitors within minutes of installation. Results improve over the first 24-48 hours as more traffic flows through.</p></div>"},{"t":"div","c":"text-center py-8","h":"<p class=\"text-muted-foreground mb-4\">Need help? Reach out to our team.</p><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 py-2 gradient-cta text-primary-foreground border-0 hover:opacity-90 font-semibold\">Contact Support</button>"}]}